PenguKit NOTICE
================

PenguKit is an independent, from-scratch implementation written in Rust,
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

It is informed by, and references as ground truth, the open-source WolvenKit
project and its lineage (CP77Tools by rfuzzo). Per the GPL-3.0, the authors of
those projects are acknowledged here:

  * WolvenKit / CP77Tools — community mod editor and command-line toolkit for
    REDengine 4 (Cyberpunk 2077). GPL-3.0.
    https://github.com/WolvenKit/WolvenKit

File-format understanding (RDAR archives, CR2W containers, XBM/DDS, TweakDB,
Wwise WEM, Bink containers) derives from studying these open-source projects
and the CP2077 modding wiki (wiki.redmodding.org).

Bundled native libraries (shipped in the `natives/` directory):

  * libkraken.so — Kraken compression/decompression by RAD Game Tools,
    distributed with WolvenKit. Rad Game Tools provides Kraken for free
    integration in games (https://www.radgametools.com/).
  * libwwtools.so — Wwise audio conversion tool by the WolvenKit team
    (https://github.com/WolvenKit/wwise-audio-tools).

Third-party licenses reproduced in full in their respective upstream
repositories. No Windows binaries, Windows DLLs, or Wine are used anywhere
in this project.

